<TITLE>Oil Level Detection Mechanism</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>A new oil level detection mechanism (overflow method) has been adopted.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>When adjusting the oil level during repair or replacement, the oil level can be adjusted mechanically by the overflow method, improving the accuracy of oil level control. For detailed oil filling and adjustment procedures, refer to the Repair Manual.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
